    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Bundle parent Product2 records (with bundle ConfigurationType) that have no ProductRelatedComponent children.
Why it matters: An empty bundle adds nothing at quote time — sales sees a wrapper SKU with no configurable parts. Often abandoned bundle migrations.
Suppress a finding: for placeholder bundles awaiting components.
Disable the detector: only in orgs without bundles. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
